{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If you walk for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes at a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rate\" title=\"Rate\">rate</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a235c77bf1b3847b1ae48a6566244dfd37cbd21b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\text{ mph}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> and then run for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/0/c90130681c52002362101bed05fa6747e38cb27e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\text{ mph}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, how many miles will you have gone at the end of one hour and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1d9621bbd48b2a39ddf1507c092800a57d827fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 3.5\\text{ miles} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8\\text{ miles} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9\\text{ miles} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 25\\frac{1}{3}\\text{ miles} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 480\\text{ miles}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"597\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since you walked for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> hour, you walked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8abaa6ee48464a285976d65029da079902944c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 4 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" /> miles.  Since you ran for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> hour, you ran <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d9d42528f70a174416a9406d066c92844bcc5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"38\" /> miles.  Therefore, you traveled a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839057642c1f54c617a21f3e0d27cf67ad458676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\text{ miles}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LOluquXpZ6A\">https://youtu.be/LOluquXpZ6A</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php